{"title": "Potion of Superior Healing", "pageid": 8769, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Potion_of_Superior_Healing", "categories": ["Potions", "Common items", "Sources of healing"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Healing\">Potion of Healing</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Greater_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Greater Healing\">Potion of Greater Healing</a> and  <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Supreme_Healing\" title=\"Potion of Supreme Healing\">Potion of Supreme Healing</a>   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:POT_Potion_of_Superior_Healing_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/POT_Potion_of_Superior_Healing_Faded.png/300px-POT_Potion_of_Superior_Healing_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/0/0d/POT_Potion_of_Superior_Healing_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Superior Healing image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/POT_Potion_of_Superior_Healing_Faded.png/300px-POT_Potion_of_Superior_Healing_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/POT_Potion_of_Superior_Healing_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Potion of Superior Healing</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumable</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Potions\" title=\"Potions\">Potion</a>). It restores <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> when consumed.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><s