png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></span><br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/38px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/50px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/25px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> the potion.\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Aoe Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>Creates area: Potion of Superior Healing</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Potion_of_Superior_Healing\"> Area: Potion of Superior Healing </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Superior_Healing_(cloud)\" title=\"Potion of Superior Healing (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp/45px-Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/eb/Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Potion of Superior Healing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/eb/Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/eb/Potion_of_Superior_Healing_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Superior_Healing_(cloud)\" title=\"Potion of Superior Healing (cloud)\">Potion of Superior Healing</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n<p>Recover <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">8d4+8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/38px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/50px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">hit points</span></a> and stop <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning (Condition)\">Burning</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Cloud\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Cloud</a></dd>\n\n</dl> </span>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Obtainable from various merchants, enemies, and locations throughout the game (will be included randomly at vendors starting at level 8)\n<ul><li>Examples of merchants typically offering this item include <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anna_Lidwin\" title=\"Anna Lidwin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png/25px-Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png/38px-Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png/50px-Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sister Lidwin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png/25px-Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Portrait_Anna_Lidwin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Anna_Lidwin\" title=\"Anna Lidwin\">Sister Lidwin</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/25px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/38px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/50px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A'jak'nir Jeera\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png/25px-Portrait_Jeera.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Jeera.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jeera\" title=\"Jeera\">A'jak'nir Jeera</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Cr%C3%A8che_Y%27llek\" title=\"Crèche Y'llek\">Crèche Y'llek</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Can be crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Musk_Creeper\" title=\"Salts of Musk Creeper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/30px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/40px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Musk_Creeper\" title=\"Salts of Musk Creeper\">Salts of Musk Creeper</a> (procured from<span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals\" title=\"Yellow Musk Creeper Petals\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png/20px-Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png/30px-Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png/40px-Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png/20px-Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Yellow_Musk_Creeper_Petals\" title=\"Yellow Musk Creeper Petals\">Yellow Musk Creeper Petals</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Suspension</a></li>\n<li>Under most circumstances, purchasing the ingredients will be substantially more expensive than purchasing the potion directly from a merchant</li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 142px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 140px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"